                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                        "entry_id": "d919929c-a485-3a71-a5a3-b805d3a51149",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act or process of mismounting."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27c5b0dc-04ce-4f51-961e-81861de593ce",
                                "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                                "text": "She was very stiff and lame, and was made more so by a mismount, catching in her saddle and tipping down on the bruised side; but she picked up and went at it again with a will, and after a wobble or two across the road, was bowling along at the same risky pace as before."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dde43bf2-802f-4d74-82ec-28808c198ccf",
                                "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                                "text": "This capability can be used to reduce or eliminate significant sources of lost data and processing time, such as operator mismounts, incorrect volume specification, and a number of integrity flaws that are described in the integrity section."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d468f3b-955a-4a6d-ae6b-a2b766ae5b7a",
                                "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                                "text": "In some cases we also encountered very bad results probably due to the mismount of the sample."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c96ac909-9613-4417-847b-a6d7e46e46d2",
                                "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                                "text": "If the gun is mismounted then the eye-barrel relationship is off and the benefits of the gunfit exponentially decrease the farther away the bird is. A mismount at twenty-five yards often leads to a crippled bird, and the dog often has a hard time finding it. Also that same mismount on a forty-yard bird is probably a clean miss."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "604744a8-cf14-4403-aedb-ef24ddb09eb0",
                                "sense_id": "5360c51a-12d3-3345-8478-27b551af4a3b",
                                "text": "A mismount can allow them to rip out of the ski, but this is highly unlikely, since you'll likely be putting even less torque on these bindings."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
