                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f60dad70-d978-4779-a26f-b0f0371e33ef",
                                "sense_id": "a361c815-10a4-35c5-b5f9-0ad2c6cb74f2",
                                "text": "One afternoon his foreman, Joe, passes John's area just in time to see him mismount a piece on dures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee20c48f-9489-4464-a041-3562dd3abaff",
                                "sense_id": "a361c815-10a4-35c5-b5f9-0ad2c6cb74f2",
                                "text": "“You can't afford to mismount a tire,” he said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef975cce-e8e9-46cb-a05a-96a63608169c",
                                "sense_id": "a361c815-10a4-35c5-b5f9-0ad2c6cb74f2",
                                "text": "If the gun is mismounted then the eye-barrel relationship is off and the benefits of the gunfit exponentially decrease the farther away the bird is."
